The Sears keep an oracular device that forecasts the weather over [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. The device broke when a clear night turned into the endless rain over Hallia. Local diviners hold that the rain will last until the Sears work out what is wrong with it, after which they will broadcast an updated prediction.
